ginal":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oDiy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6a863612-c6c5-4b17-ae4f-af00ef82766c","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"「どうしてLinuxメインなの?」\n「Software developerかついまのところiOSアプリ開発を行わないからです。あえてWindowsやMacを用いてもよいんですが、Linuxだと単に開発環境の準備やメンテなどがすごいラクなので...」","ts":"1630793743.166000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8ie"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8dc34e80-a784-429c-b2c3-6e3662e59191","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"「どうしてLinuxメインなの？」\n「Windowsは色々と自動化しにくいからね…」\n「それならmacOSでもできるのでは？」\n「うるせぇ黙って毒林檎齧って万歳三唱しとけApple信者が！」","ts":"1630793396.162800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8p0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b3d64ee9-cdc0-46f7-9d25-2388c5ca161e","type":"message","user":"U01PQE8LNE9","text":"\u0026gt; 「どうしてLinuxメインなの？」\n単純に挙動が軽くて速く動く(気がする)しそれだけで理由としては十分な気がする。何をやらせても遅いIDEよりVimの方が快適なのと同じ","ts":"1630785843.161100","thread_ts":"1630785843.161100","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9vU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fd63f48a-467d-4188-a6ef-ad5d5f7822c9","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"ああ、レジストリ操作もやらないといけないんだったなぁ","ts":"1630799805.177400","thread_ts":"1630797467.173600","parent_user_id":"U7JL1UKKL","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OgY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c1ac4ad4-0e8e-42a3-ae9c-18b046128999","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"すべてをテキスト外部コマンドという文化にはどうしてもあわない設計になってしまっている","ts":"1630799827.177600","thread_ts":"1630797467.173600","parent_user_id":"U7JL1UKKL","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IyY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"edfb8ce7-a7ac-4cf6-8880-59d27338aca0","type":"message","user":"U01PQE8LNE9","text":"少なくともターミナルとDockerに関してはLinuxの方がmacOSより速く動くというのは事実だ